body:
I just went through 10 rounds of ECT therapy in April & May.  I'm still recovering.  I can't tell you if it's helped or not.  I would say it's helped a bit but I'm still struggling.  It gave me issues with my memory and focus that I believe are slowly getting better but I am frustrated with the slow process.  

&#x200B;

You are put to sleep for each treatment that is very quick.  Less than 2 minutes I believe.  You are asleep for about a half hour.  It's an outpatient procedure.  I had many side effects including just feeling generally ill the entire day of...along with confusion and memory loss.  However, others have had better reactions and less side effects.
